# Intentionally (near) empty.
#
# This directory is the Vercel `outputDirectory`. SmartPrint's API deploys as a
# Node.js serverless function (see `api/index.ts` + `vercel.json` rewrites), so
# there are no static frontend assets to serve here. Vercel's build pipeline
# still requires an output directory to exist; this empty folder satisfies that
# requirement WITHOUT exposing the repository root as static files. All HTTP
# traffic is rewritten to the Express serverless function.
